      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Minimally invasive injection therapy is an effective approach for the treatment of sciatica with less complications. This therapy is a sufficient option in cases without absolute indications for operation.The paper describes in detail the different injection techniques like spinal nerve analgesia, epidural dorsal/perineural injections, vertebral joint infiltrations, and radiculographies."},
